{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号白字，紫色强调词“喜欢没藏住，被看出多在乎”尤其醒目；随后容易转向下方第二块同样醒目的大字。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"多次想表达却忍住，这次喜欢没藏住，对方看出了自己有多在乎。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"空落落、害怕被嫌太黏，带有不安和失落。\",\n  \"missed\": \"以前还能装作不在乎、如今熟悉的亲近却像隔了一层，以及幸福是否真实、能维持多久等补充内容。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块字号接近、亮度相近的大字都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"处境主要在上方，具体的失落和不安主要在下方，核心意思需要拼接两块才能完整理解。\",\n    \"两块大字各自包含多个层次的信息，需要读完整句才能理清变化和关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "83dc0915-bd52-462e-aa13-69e4dfd72b4e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T021442007108Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:15:25.723023+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ec42652d7563b458f165405be52bdc321980bb5e144435c4946a4e9646ce0676", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\